BT /F1 11 Tf 60 711 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 696 Td (Annual leave. Full-time employees receive 20 days of paid annual leave per calendar) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 681 Td (year, plus public holidays. Part-time employees receive leave pro rata. Up to 5 unused) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 666 Td (days may be carried over into the next year; carried-over days expire on March 31.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 651 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 636 Td (Requesting leave. Request leave in the HR portal \(Workday\) at least two weeks in advance) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 621 Td (for absences longer than three days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 606 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 591 Td (Sick leave. Employees receive 10 days of paid sick leave per year. A doctor's note is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 576 Td (required for absences longer than three consecutive days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 561 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 546 Td (Parental leave. Primary caregivers receive 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 531 Td (secondary caregivers receive 6 weeks. Parental leave can be taken within 12 months of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 60 516 Td (the birth or adoption.) Tj ET
